category: Security
requires: girepository-GLib2.0 girepository-GUsb1.0 libfprint2_2 libglib2.0-devel
sdesc: "Toolkit for fingerprint scanner (GObject Introspection data)"
ldesc: "libfprint is an open source software library designed to make it easy for
application developers to add support for consumer fingerprint readers to
their software."
external-source: libfprint

